  "NROOT" [label="(0,0,0) This paper proposes systematically mining publicly available RNA-seq libraries from diverse Oryza species with complementary homology-based, homology-independent, and broader metagenomic methods to discover, assemble, and classify previously hidden RNA viruses, thereby expanding the rice virome and providing viral resources relevant to improved disease surveillance and disease management.", fillcolor="lightyellow", style="filled"];
